' (-txt -keycase -varcase -alpha:alt), as tools/detok.sh --keep-spaces in
' ImageBBS3 does; detok.sh wouldn't write it: the original jumps to a line
' C64List can't find (see below), so the rebuild wasn't byte-identical.

' Image BBS 128 (10/20/2026): C64 addresses in peek/poke are the 128's,
' as {sym:...} names from asm/equates.asm (included below).
